"登录启动已关闭。可退出后删除 ScreenDown.app；设置保留在 /Users/Shared/ScreenDown。" = "Launch at login is disabled. Quit and delete ScreenDown.app to remove the app. Settings remain in /Users/Shared/ScreenDown.";
"所有显示器离线后开始计时；重新连接立即取消。开机后需先检测到显示器才会启用计时。暂停、修改设置或睡眠唤醒后重新计时。\n\n模拟模式仅记录结果。取消模拟模式后会执行系统级关机。退出应用会暂停监测；重新打开后需手动恢复。\n\n断电和拔线也会视作离线。后台组件开机运行，菜单栏应用登录启动。" = "The countdown starts when all displays go offline and cancels when any display reconnects. A display must be detected after startup before monitoring is armed. Pausing, changing settings, or waking from sleep resets the countdown.\n\nSimulation mode only records the result. Turn it off to enable system shutdown. Quitting pauses monitoring; resume it manually when you reopen the app.\n\nUnplugging a display or disconnecting its power also counts as offline. The helper starts at boot; the menu bar app starts at login.";
